{
  "name": "formcoach",
  "description": "Sensor-gated webcam form coaching: a wrist wearable (Seeed XIAO ESP32-S3 + BMI160) runs a tiny int8 neural network that detects exercise reps and gates a laptop pipeline using MediaPipe pose estimation and biomechanical rules to give per-rep form feedback on four dumbbell exercises. Note: this project has over 100 source files; consider scoping analysis to a subdirectory for faster results.",
